        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, sorry to keep you waiting.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, walking side by side like this... Has it actually been a while？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe it has... Sorry.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's fine. Just make sure you pay plenty of attention to me from now on.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mmm...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We went to Atami together, didn't we？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, we did... Were you just thinking about it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah... I think back on it a lot. It was fun... and it's pretty high up on my list of favorite memories.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>More than anything... it was the longest we ever got to spend together.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>…………。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Have you been staring at me or something？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Who knows？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You totally are. What, did you fall for me all over again？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Not to brag or anything, but I really do feel like I've gotten prettier lately.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. You don't have to answer, though I do have a pretty hopeful look in my eyes right now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You do？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I sure do. Come on, let me get a good look at your face.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Look right at me, straight on.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Don't stay so far away. Come closer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Your face is way too close. I can see you fine without you coming that close.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah, okay, okay. Now give me a big smile.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Smile for me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, got my smile. Hehe.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Are you embarrassed or something？ Well, whatever.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Just thinking how quiet it is...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Urgh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, that's all for now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Don't be so impatient.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We've got plenty of fun stuff ahead of us, after all.</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
